  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nUnable to move apps in dynamic zone after moving an app from dynamic zone to category.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHave multiple apps in dynamic zone, move an app from dynamic zone to category, try moving another app from dynamic zone, the dynamic zone will be moved instead.\n\n### Impact\n\nThis will force the user to first move apps onto the base board if the user wanted to move more than a single app from the dynamic zone to the category.\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version\n\n1.17.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Run\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
